{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10125250","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10125250","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1012525001:0":{"text":"이곳에 어지러운 발자국이 많은데, 그중에 어린아이의 발자국도 있어.","source_cn":"这里有许多凌乱的脚印，其中有小孩子的脚印。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EEB3D3C6350F65C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1012525002:0":{"text":"발자국이 아주 뚜렸하네요. 이반 씨, 당신 아이는 멀리 가지 않았을 거예요.","source_cn":"脚印很新。伊凡先生，你的孩子应该没走太远。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7A21B846489ED28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012525003:0":{"text":"어서! 서둘러야 해요!","source_cn":"快！大人们，我们得快点！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x935CA5DFCBFB4AC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"에이론","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"브라이언","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:村长伊凡":{"text":"촌장 이반","source":"村长伊凡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}}